{"role":"assistant","content":"Начинаю с `config.py` — исправляю scope и убираю неиспользуемый `REFRESH_INTERVAL`.","tool_calls":[{"type":"function","id":"tool_izm1J0hCTeGU43IYNdIdraFi","function":{"name":"Edit","arguments":"{\"path\":\"config.py\",\"old_string\":\"SCOPES = \\\"ACTIVITY:READ,ACTIVITY:WRITE,WELLNESS:READ,CALENDAR:READ,CALENDAR:WRITE\\\"\\n\\nREFRESH_INTERVAL = 60      # seconds between passes of the token refresher\",\"new_string\":\"# Intervals rejects a scope listing the same area twice (:WRITE implies :READ),\\n# so each area appears at most once.\\nSCOPES = \\\"ACTIVITY:WRITE,WELLNESS:READ,CALENDAR:WRITE\\\"\"}"}}]}
